# The Vercel deployment is only the hosted demo (vercel.json). Ship just what it
# runs: the demo, the README scenario it replays, and the core SDK source.
/*
!vercel.json
!examples
!packages
examples/*
!examples/local-observability-demo
!examples/multi-tenant-cost-report
packages/*
!packages/lumen-ai-core
**/.runtime
**/__pycache__
